Audit complete: **CONCERNS / LEGIT**.

The proof rebuilds cleanly and reaches `#Top`; the false-result mutation fails meaningfully, confirming non-vacuity. The concern is an incomplete non-Latin-1 Python `str` → K runtime input bridge, demonstrated with Unicode palindromes.

